{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordeguard</strong> is a brutal 3D action tower defense with RPG and strategy elements, playable solo or in local co-op. Build, fortify, and defend your Viking settlement against hordes of mythical creatures. Explore the realms of Norse mythology, gather resources, and make choices that decide between survival and ruin. Build. Defend. Conquer. Withstand the storm. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b3c2fe6b78e4ede4497f63f015a7546f.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/6018c6fa9bd94efdbd7b26a095ecd449.webp?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=49 /></span><br>The horde is coming, and there\u2019s no time to rest. Every wave grows stronger, every battle bloodier. Your only chance is to fight smarter, strike harder, and rebuild faster than the enemy can destroy. Victory belongs to those who never fall.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/2fd262d191b1752e74bf672c0a35dd0f.poster.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/2fd262d191b1752e74bf672c0a35dd0f.webm?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/2fd262d191b1752e74bf672c0a35dd0f.mp4?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b3c2fe6b78e4ede4497f63f015a7546f.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/41cc555fb139021f3a9b4f3ffdeb22e4.webp?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=49 /></span><br>Expand your village, upgrade your defenses, and turn humble walls into an unbreakable fortress. Each upgrade demands more resources, but rewards you with greater strength and resilience. The stronger your base, the harder it is for the horde to break through - if you can afford the cost.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/47deb7b7eaac233b8253f9a7a5ed5df9.poster.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/47deb7b7eaac233b8253f9a7a5ed5df9.webm?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/47deb7b7eaac233b8253f9a7a5ed5df9.mp4?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b3c2fe6b78e4ede4497f63f015a7546f.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/4641535a64dad82148f8355fc65bcea0.webp?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=49 /></span><br>As you battle and earn XP, you\u2019ll unlock upgrade cards that boost your skills and fortifications. Pick your path - become a fierce warrior, a master builder, or the ultimate defender. Every card you choose makes you stronger for the next fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/e17899ddb65f6e7d301d87dbcfbc9efe.poster.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/e17899ddb65f6e7d301d87dbcfbc9efe.webm?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/e17899ddb65f6e7d301d87dbcfbc9efe.mp4?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b3c2fe6b78e4ede4497f63f015a7546f.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/a50367f5ad705b82fed9f02637ff00ba.webp?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=49 /></span><br>Fight side by side in <strong>local co-op</strong> and discover the true power of teamwork. Whether you play as a shield-bearing axe warrior or a skilled huntress with bow and arrows, every role matters. One gathers resources while the other builds; one defends while the other repairs. Together you adapt, survive, and laugh in the chaos \u2014 because no Viking should stand alone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/9682374907b9ca3d65851ae1ec4b9095.poster.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/9682374907b9ca3d65851ae1ec4b9095.webm?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/9682374907b9ca3d65851ae1ec4b9095.mp4?t=1773424337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618000?t=1773424337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618000?t=1773424337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/99d9c00bd4c6b5a2174a0b9762747de0859886be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773424337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/99d9c00bd4c6b5a2174a0b9762747de0859886be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773424337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordeguard</strong> is a brutal 3D action tower defense with RPG and strategy elements, playable solo or in local co-op. Build, fortify, and defend your Viking settlement against hordes of mythical creatures. Explore the realms of Norse mythology, gather resources, and make choices that decide between survival and ruin. Build. Defend. Conquer. Withstand the storm. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/b3c2fe6b78e4ede4497f63f015a7546f.avif?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618000/extras/6018c6fa9bd94efdbd7b26a095ecd449.webp?t=1773424337\" width=1452 height=49 /></spa